<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερισχύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be exceedingly strong,</i> of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					24.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span> ib.q<i><span class="en">
				<u>Es.</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.41
			</span></i>; of trees, <i>to be too luxuriant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.18.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>to be overbearing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				4638.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen., <i>to be stronger than, prevail over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.29.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				17.18
			</span></i>: also c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.58
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3p.66
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				119.30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
